**Venue.** Quantum 7, 974 (2023)
**arXiv.** 2209.00292v3

## Extraction note

Full-text extraction for this paper was performed via `pdftotext -layout` (see `work/paper.txt`); nougat was not run in this wave to preserve wave-budget compute for the MC simulation. This stub records:

1. The paper metadata (above)
2. The extracted headline equation (Theorem 3, Eq. 13, j<i=N branch), which is the specific claim exercised by this replication:

$$
\mathrm{Var}[\partial_{1,1} \langle X_N \rangle_{qMPS}] = 11 \cdot \left(\frac{1}{8}\right)^2 \cdot \left(\frac{3}{8}\right)^{N-1}
$$

3. Pointer to the raw text and PDF: `work/paper.txt`, `work/paper.pdf`

If a nougat pass is subsequently required (e.g. for structured equation extraction across all theorems), the recommended command (on uicgpu with GPU): `nougat --markdown work/paper.pdf -o extraction/`. Estimated cost: <5 min on one A100 for a ~30-page paper. No paid endpoint required.

